{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18503","headline":"九日广陵同陈十五先辈登高怀林十二先辈 · 欧阳詹","name":"九日广陵同陈十五先辈登高怀林十二先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客路重阳日，登高寄上楼。\n风烟今令节，台阁古雄州。\n泛菊聊斟酒，持萸嬾插头。\n情人共惆怅，良久不同游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}